---

This project builds upon and takes inspiration from:

- WebGen-Agent (arXiv:2509.22644) — the web generation agent with multi-level
  visual feedback that motivated this work.
- Waffle (ACL 2025, arXiv:2410.18362) — structure-aware attention and
  contrastive fine-tuning for UI-to-code alignment.

Please see docs/DESIGN.md for an in-depth discussion of how GUIxcoder relates
to and differs from this prior work.
